            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipuopuo intae aatiu anaa iloata osirua osinya kewarie iranyishosho. Nitumutumu eng'ida o ltau nitiuu anaa te neoshi enkinanta pee epuoi oldoinyo lo Laitoriani, ina dapidapoi e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa keisho Olaitoriani ilo toilo lenye le nkitoo metoning'o pooki ng'ae, ore ina oshoto e nkaina enye nedou metodoli te ngoro napi o te nkima namutisho, te nebo olkutati o enchan oo soito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore lelo le Asiria naa keiput enkiputukuny o lkirutoto te nening ilo toilo lo Laitoriani, ina kata eoshisho ninye te ng'udi enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eosh Olaitoriani, ninche aigil, netoni iltung'ana lenyena aaranyisho too lwululi o too nkai oo sinkolioitin Enkai makewan naarare ile Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 30:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eidipaki apa aaitobira ewueji neyupuyup; ee te nkaraki ilo aiguanani, eitobiraki endapasho o enguton, netii ilkeek kumok o enkima kitok. Naa enkiyang'et o Laitoriani naikununo anaa enkima nakutu isoito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.30.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.30.33"
            ]
          }
        }
